OL,3,GNEWSAWork to improve town centre due to
OL,4,Astart
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major scheme to improve a Lancashire
OL,7,Ftown centre is set to begin on Monday,
OL,8,Fas part of the Levelling Up East
OL,9,FLancashire programme.
OL,11,FLancashire County Council said
OL,12,Fimprovements to Bank Street in
OL,13,FRawtenstall, were intended to make a
OL,14,F"safer, more attractive and accessible"
OL,15,Fenvironment for residents, businesses
OL,16,Fand visitors.
OL,18,FPreparatory work has also started at
OL,19,FHall Carr estate, where works will help
OL,20,Fmake it easier and safer for people to
OL,21,Ftravel between homes, jobs, shops and
OL,22,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
